  "user_request_original": "Design a 21-layer defect-cavity dielectric coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: air / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / SiO2 (Lemarchand)_substrate with layer 11 (hfo2) serving as the central cavity. Optimize 18 mirror layer thicknesses and 1 cavity layer thickness to create a transmission resonance in 1000-1700 nm band while maintaining high reflectance in 300-450 nm band. Use only hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) materials. Maximum 30 layers constraint satisfied with 21 layers.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Design a 21-layer high-index/low-index defect-cavity dielectric coating on fused silica with air incidence. The stack alternates hfo2 and sio2 (Lemarchand) with layer 11 as an hfo2 defect cavity. Optimize 18 mirror and 1 cavity layer thicknesses to maximize transmittance in 1000–1700 nm while maximizing reflectance in 300–450 nm at normal incidence, unpolarized light.",
